@startuml
title State diagram for Ott Based System Mini Reel

[*] --> NotLoggedIn

state NotLoggedIn
NotLoggedIn : do / display login/signup options

state CreatingAccount
CreatingAccount : do / collect user details

state LoggedIn
LoggedIn : do / display video feed

state WatchingVideo
WatchingVideo : do / play video

state SavingVideo
SavingVideo : do / add video to likes list

state ViewingLikes
ViewingLikes : do / display liked videos

state Discussion
Discussion : do / display discussion forum

NotLoggedIn --> CreatingAccount : Choose Signup
CreatingAccount --> NotLoggedIn : Signup Complete
CreatingAccount --> NotLoggedIn : Signup Failed

NotLoggedIn --> LoggedIn : Successful Login
LoggedIn --> WatchingVideo : Select Video
WatchingVideo --> SavingVideo : Click Like Button
WatchingVideo --> LoggedIn : Back to Feed
WatchingVideo --> Discussion : Enter Discussion

SavingVideo --> WatchingVideo : Like Added
LoggedIn --> ViewingLikes : View Likes
ViewingLikes --> LoggedIn : Back to Feed
LoggedIn --> Discussion : Enter Discussion

@enduml
